    {
      "id": "claim_f395d12a6ba847f0becfe4183426fbf5",
      "statement": "llm-access (io.github.ardoco:llm-access) is a Java 21 library for accessing LLMs and embedding models through LangChain4j (version 1.22.0, imported as the langchain4j-bom). It is framework-neutral: model settings are passed as plain configuration records (LlmConfiguration for chat, EmbeddingConfiguration for embeddings) while credentials and host URLs are read from an injected EnvironmentProvider — there is no global environment.",
