      "id": "claim_3db2587bf07d4ef185f5594a879dd483",
      "statement": "The code was extracted from the LiSSA project so LiSSA, ardoco, and other tools can share one implementation, and the LOCAL on-disk cache format remains compatible with LiSSA's existing caches: the file identifier omits the temperature component when it is 0.0, and file content is addressed via a deterministic UUID derived from the (line-ending-normalized) content.",
